    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): SPLIT-SITE (ii) "Where the trustee-manager of a registered business trust or recognised business trust is informed pursuant to a notice given to any person under subsection (1) or under this subsection that any other person has an interest in any of the voting units in the business trust, the trustee-manager may by written notice require that other person"

